f9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"OX3ArWSP85bK4cdk51tdmw","review_id":"9Okz2JhCHz4IKZOYESMQCQ","date":"2018-08-06T22:15:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.944129228591919,"text_excerpt":"Came here with a group of six and had a blast! I found out about this distillery through Groupon when there was a Groupon deal for them. If it hadn't been for the deal, then I probably would not have found this place. This was my very first distillery tour and I had no idea what to expect. I imagined that we would just taste different kinds of spirits that they make, and the tour guides would just tell us about each one. Little did I know at the time, it was much more than that! The distillery was located closer than I expected and is pretty small. It is located on N Claiborne, right under the bridge near the Superdome. They have their own parking lot for customers, so you don't have to w..."},{"business_id":"OX3ArWSP85bK4cdk51tdmw","review_id":"cV8yOv4IY9wWvRDtEbkT4w","date":"2020-01-12T18:05:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9373735785484314,"text_excerpt":"This a cool distillery located in the old Treme neighborhood. I would highly recommend doing the tasting + tour, so that you can sample all their great spirits (vodka, gin, rum x2, whiskey, tequila). The best one by far is their gin, which is incredibly smooth and flavorful. They also include some of the history about New Orleans neighborhoods and what has inspired their story. The tour then takes you into the back where they have barrels lining the walls and distilling equipment on full display. The guide tells you about how to read the markings on barrels and gives you an inside look into the distilling process. The entire building is immaculate and beautifully designed. The tour ends a..."},{"business_id":"OX3ArWSP85bK4cdk51tdmw","review_id":"NXJ6Rn41CLNHNMZVeZn03g","date":"2019-03-21T19:42:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9336868524551392,"text_excerpt":"So we were a little lost as to what we should do in NOLA, and came across to one of the tours at Seven Three Distilling. Not expecting much, we decided to give it a go and were actually glad that we did the tour. Our tour guide Saled (I'm so sorry if ur names mispelled :( ), was very friendly and super informative. Not only was it very pleasant to try out the different types of spirits that Seven Three Distilling had to offer, it was very educational, and provided us a good insight as to what NOLA culture was and the rich history in this city. Would highly recommend if you want your NOLA experience to be as smooth as their spirits"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"OX3ArWSP85bK4cdk51tdmw","photo_id":"Yzq5HQ5ljrOZrdmALiJ69Q","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Yzq5HQ5ljrOZrdmALiJ69Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9204309582710266},{"business_id":"OX3ArWSP85bK4cdk51tdmw","photo_id":"fhXPno_5Hx6vFI1AeYJU2A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/fhXPno_5Hx6vFI1AeYJU2A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8572835326194763},{"business_id":"OX3ArWSP85bK4cdk51tdmw","photo_id":"HRr5HQDSA_Z77TfnmCtekw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/HRr5HQDSA_Z77TfnmCtekw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8123722076416016},{"business_id":"OX3ArWSP85bK4cdk51tdmw","photo_id":"KWovp_EiU4ox67CcOhYyyA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/KWovp_EiU4ox67CcOhYyyA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7891945838928223},{"business_id":"OX3ArWSP85bK4cdk51tdmw","photo_id":"8m1NQAeZG1xm6SCyv9fUag","labe